cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "density-penalty-paper: reproduction archive for \"Preferential centrality with a density penalty\""
message: >-
  Please cite the note together with this archive when using its scripts or
  archived runs, and cite prefcent for the solver.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hellervik
    given-names: Alexander
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5899-718X"
    affiliation: Chalmers University of Technology
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/prefcent/density-penalty-paper
abstract: >-
  Scripts, archived states and run manifests behind the eight figures of
  "Preferential centrality with a density penalty: formulation and an
  open-source implementation" (Hellervik, 2026): 23 figure runs and seven
  multi-start sweeps (19,692 runs) on synthetic landscapes, all solved with
  prefcent 0.1.1. make check re-solves runs and compares their result hashes
  with the archived manifests.
keywords:
  - preferential centrality
  - spatial interaction
  - density penalty
  - reproducibility
